<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="bg">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Честит 8-ми март, Стефи!</title>
    <style>
        body {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            background-color: pink;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .heart {
            position: relative;
            width: 100px;
            height: 100px;
            background-color: red;
            transform: rotate(-45deg);
            margin-top: 50px;
        }
        .heart:before,
        .heart:after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            width: 100px;
            height: 100px;
            background-color: red;
            border-radius: 50%;
        }
        .heart:before {
            top: -50px;
            left: 0;
        }
        .heart:after {
            left: 50px;
            top: 0;
        }
        .text {
            position: absolute;
            top: 30%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            color: white;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="heart">
        <div class="text">Честит 8-ми март, Стефи!<br>Обичам те!</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
